⬇️FULL RECIPE⬇️
300 calories 32g protein (for the entire pint, mix-ins/toppings included) 😋🤤
Americone Dream Protein Ice Cream 😋🍦

Original recipe from my Recipe Book

Check out the link in my bio for my Creami Recipe Books with over 100 recipes like this one!

- 1 Vanilla Protein Shake (I like the ones from @Nurri)
- 25g @Lakanto Monk Fruit sweetener
- 2.5g (½ tsp) vanilla bean paste (or extract)
- 1g (¼ tsp) salt
- 1g (¼ tsp) xanthan gum
Toppings:
- 1 serving chocolate filled waffle cones (130 cal)
- 7g caramel sauce
300 cal 27g C, 7g F, 32g P

Instructions:
1. Blend all ingredients for the base and freeze (at least 16 hours)
2. Run under hot water for at least 60 seconds
3. Spin on “Lite Ice Cream” setting
4. Spin on “Respin” setting
5. Respin again if powdery
6. Top with crumbled up waffle cone pieces
7. Drizzle with caramel syrup

